OL,3,GNEWSA#1.4m funding for Brighton and
OL,4,AHove roads programme
OL,5,
OL,6,FRoads and pavements across Brighton and
OL,7,FHove are to benefit from extra funding
OL,8,Ffor an improvement programme.
OL,10,FThe city council has been awarded #1.4m
OL,11,Fin funding from the Department for
OL,12,FTransport towards its ongoing
OL,13,Fresurfacing and pothole-filling work.
OL,15,FIn total, the authority in East Sussex
OL,16,Fsaid it will be spending #8.8m on road
OL,17,Fand pavement maintenance during 2026
OL,18,Fand 2027.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
