OL,3,GNEWSA#1.4m funding for Brighton and
OL,4,AHove roads programme
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrevor Muten, cabinet member for
OL,7,Ftransport and city infrastructure,
OL,8,Fdescribed the government award as a
OL,9,F"testament to the hard work being done
OL,10,Fby the team".
